"The :func:`itertools.compress` function mimics its namesake from APL.  Also, "
"the existing :func:`itertools.count` function now has an optional *step* "
"argument and can accept any type of counting sequence "
"including :class:`fractions.Fraction` and :class:`decimal.Decimal`::"
msgstr ""
